OL,3,GNEWSAWeddings 'kicked into touch' at
OL,4,ABath Rugby HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FBath Rugby has been told it can no
OL,7,Flonger hold weddings at its rural
OL,8,Fheadquarters following a decision by
OL,9,FSomerset Council.
OL,11,FBath Rugby's official base is at
OL,12,FFarleigh House on Church Farm Lane, on
OL,13,Fthe outskirts of the village of
OL,14,FFarleigh Hungerford.
OL,16,FThe site has been the club's
OL,17,Fheadquarters since 2010, and has been
OL,18,Fused for weddings, corporate events and
OL,19,Fprivate functions, including erecting
OL,20,Ftemporary marquees within the grounds.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
