OL,3,GNEWSAWeddings 'kicked into touch' at
OL,4,ABath Rugby HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Farleigh House website states it is
OL,7,Fno longer accepting new wedding or
OL,8,Fcorporate event enquiries, but will
OL,9,Fhonour "all existing confirmed bookings
OL,10,Fscheduled for 2026".
